  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- Majorsilence.Forms migration track (Track D). 26.0.20 is packed locally from
         ../Modern.Forms source (see nuget.config and MIGRATION-NOTES.md); none of 26.0.1
         through 26.0.20 is in the 26.0.0 published on nuget.org yet. Full per-patch breakdown of
         what each version added is in ../Modern.Forms's git log (one commit per patch) and in
         MIGRATION-NOTES.md's D2/D4/D5/D6 sections; not repeated here to keep this file readable.
         26.0.16-26.0.20 fixed, in turn: TabControl.SelectedIndex throwing on an empty tab strip;
         ComponentResourceManager never actually reading a normal project's compiled .resources
         (it only looked for a raw XML .resx); IsMdiContainer's MDI client covering already-docked
         menu/toolbar/status strip siblings instead of yielding to their claimed space;
         text-drawing controls shorter than one line's natural height (13px, the WinForms designer's
         own AutoSize Label default) rendering nothing at all; and a popup (so every menu dropdown)
         closing immediately after opening, a race between PopupWindow.Show's suppression of its
         own parent's deactivation and that deactivation actually being delivered a tick later on
         the Avalonia backend. All five found via the exact same real bug report:
         ReportDesigner.Forms rendering first as a totally blank window, then progressively closer
         to correct as each was found and fixed in turn. Also note: win-compat was rebased onto
         Modern.Forms main during this same pass, which independently changed
         Form.ShowDialog(IWin32Window)/ShowDialogAsync(Form)'s split (see the ShowDialogAsync call
         sites in RdlDesign.Forms's Dialog*.cs/RdlDesigner.cs/RdlUserControl.cs/MDIChild.cs, updated
         to match in the same commit as the 26.0.19 version bump). -->
    <PackageVersion Include="Majorsilence.Forms" Version="26.0.20" />
    <PackageVersion Include="Majorsilence.Forms.Avalonia" Version="26.0.20" />
    <PackageVersion Include="Majorsilence.Forms.Headless" Version="26.0.20" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>